<title>USA: TABLE - HealthPlan Q2 shr up before charge.</title>
<headline>TABLE - HealthPlan Q2 shr up before charge.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands except per share amount)</p>
<p>						 Quarter Ended June 30,</p>
<p>					  1997			   1996</p>
<p> Operating Revenue		$71,780		     $31,167</p>
<p> Interest Income			283			   696</p>
<p>   Total Revenue		   72,063			31,863</p>
<p> Agent Commissions		 16,692			10,191</p>
<p> Personnel Expenses		29,144			 8,458</p>
<p> General and Administrative    14,017			 5,854</p>
<p>Pre-Operating and Contract</p>
<p>  Start-Up Costs			 69			   309</p>
<p> Restructure			  1,374			     0</p>
<p> Integration			    780			     0</p>
<p>    Operating Expenses	   62,076			24,812</p>
<p>Earnings Before Interest</p>
<p>Expense, Provision for Income</p>
<p>Taxes, Depreciation and</p>
<p>  Amortization			9,987			 7,051</p>
<p> Depreciation and Amortization  4,342			 1,394</p>
<p>Earnings Before Interest</p>
<p>  Expense and Income Taxes	5,645			 5,657</p>
<p> Interest Expense		     996			    17</p>
<p>Income Before Provision</p>
<p>  for Taxes			   4,649			 5,640</p>
