<p>Historical Earnings Per</p>
<p>  Share of Common Stock	    0.16			  0.26</p>
<p> Average Shares		    15,026			13,456</p>
<p>NOTES: Q2 EPS was $0.27 before a pre-tax restructuring, integration and office closing expense of $2,771,000. The restructuring and integration charge was part of the original $18 million charge announced in October 1996. To date, the company has recorded $16.6 of this charge and expects the balance to be booked in 1997.</p>
<p>Full co name is HealthPlan Services Corp.</p>
